WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Start with the gold START HERE button

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:25.000
1. Prepare Fabric

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:39.000
2. Download GoNuts

00:00:39.000 --> 00:01:00.000
3. Put both mods in the right folder

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:17.000
4. Join DonutSMP, then press B

00:01:17.000 --> 00:01:36.000
5. Click START HERE → Set up trading

00:01:36.000 --> 00:01:55.000
6. Choose your spending limits

00:01:55.000 --> 00:02:13.000
7. Review protections if you use them

00:02:13.000 --> 00:02:37.000
8. Review, then Start trading

00:02:37.000 --> 00:02:55.000
9. Find Trade and get back to help

00:02:55.000 --> 00:03:14.000
